<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
	<meta charset="{charset}">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
	<link rel="icon" href="{THEME}/images/favicon.ico">
	<meta property="og:image" content="{THEME}/images/Max_logo.svg">
	<title>Сайт временно отключен</title>
	<style>
		*{box-sizing:border-box}
		html,body{min-height:100%}
		body{margin:0;background:#22313a;color:#8F9BAD;font:14px/1.7 Arial,sans-serif}
		.offpage{display:flex;min-height:100vh;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
		.wrap{width:min(100%,620px);padding:48px;border:1px solid #394e5a;border-radius:18px;background:#2b3c46;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
		.logo img{display:block;width:min(100%,240px);height:auto;margin:0 auto 32px}
		.title{margin-bottom:18px;color:#fff;font-size:30px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25}
		.reason{padding:18px 22px;border:1px solid #415969;border-radius:12px;background:#314550;color:#dcf3ff}
		.copyright{margin:22px 0 0;color:#8F9BAD}
		.accent{width:64px;height:5px;margin:0 auto 28px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FE4F70,#FFA387)}
		@media(max-width:576px){.wrap{padding:32px 22px}.title{font-size:24px}}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<main class="offpage">
		<section class="wrap">
			<div class="logo"><img src="{THEME}/images/Max_logo.svg" alt="Article"></div>
			<div class="accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			<h1 class="title">Сайт временно отключен</h1>
			<div class="reason">{reason}</div>
			<p class="copyright">Сайт временно недоступен. Пожалуйста, зайдите позже.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</body>
</html>
